--------------------------------------------------------------------

JUCE (https://juce.com)
  This project links against the JUCE framework, fetched at build time
  with a pinned release tag (see CMakeLists.txt).

  JUCE is dual-licensed:
    1. GNU General Public License v3 (or later), or
    2. A paid JUCE Commercial License (Refract Records / PACE).

  Consequence for this project, in plain terms:
    - If Berlin Vocal AI is ever distributed under GPLv3-compatible
      terms (source included), the default JUCE GPLv3 license covers it.
    - If Berlin Vocal AI is to be distributed as closed-source/paid
      software, a JUCE commercial license MUST be purchased for every
      developer working on the codebase BEFORE distribution, in
      accordance with JUCE licensing terms.

  Verify current terms at https://juce.com/legal/juce-8-licence/
  before ANY distribution of binaries built from this repository.

